data/

# out/ is gitignored repo-wide (dex/.gitignore: research/**/out/). These two are the exception:
# they are consumed as INPUTS, not produced as scratch.
#   fit_results.json    — machine interface read by the deploy scripts + collector density service
#   fit_results.v4.json — frozen 2026-07-22 v4 emit; lognormal_fit.py reads it for the old/delta
#                         legs (it can no longer read fit_results.json, which it now overwrites)
!out/
out/*
!out/fit_results.json
!out/fit_results.v4.json
